        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/72fcca80cf13161a461aecd1b9628c6e.avif?t=1761671222\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime Detective Red Flags</strong> — a game inspired by a real criminal case. The Oakland serial killer operated in Oakland, Michigan, in 1976–1977. He committed brutal murders while remaining unnoticed by the public and left a lasting mark on the region's criminal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/d6bba7406603b1d206f81beef2aeb2a6.poster.avif?t=1761671222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/d6bba7406603b1d206f81beef2aeb2a6.webm?t=1761671222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/d6bba7406603b1d206f81beef2aeb2a6.mp4?t=1761671222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Crime Detective Red Flags</strong> you play as college student Cody Harper who finds himself under house arrest in suburban America of the 1980s. To keep busy his father suggests Cody earn some extra money by helping neighbors with small tasks. The days are monotonous but in the evenings out of boredom Cody starts observing the lives of those around him. What begins as innocent curiosity soon turns into something far more sinister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an atmospheric first-person simulator focused on exploration, item interaction, and character communication.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spatial audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True crime story inspired by a real serial killer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice interaction</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/72fcca80cf13161a461aecd1b9628c6e.avif?t=1761671222\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime Detective Red Flags</strong> — a game inspired by a real criminal case. The Oakland serial killer operated in Oakland, Michigan, in 1976–1977. He committed brutal murders while remaining unnoticed by the public and left a lasting mark on the region's criminal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/d6bba7406603b1d206f81beef2aeb2a6.poster.avif?t=1761671222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/d6bba7406603b1d206f81beef2aeb2a6.webm?t=1761671222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/d6bba7406603b1d206f81beef2aeb2a6.mp4?t=1761671222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Crime Detective Red Flags</strong> you play as college student Cody Harper who finds himself under house arrest in suburban America of the 1980s. To keep busy his father suggests Cody earn some extra money by helping neighbors with small tasks. The days are monotonous but in the evenings out of boredom Cody starts observing the lives of those around him. What begins as innocent curiosity soon turns into something far more sinister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an atmospheric first-person simulator focused on exploration, item interaction, and character communication.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spatial audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True crime story inspired by a real serial killer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice interaction</p></li></ul>",
